sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: Release B moves the cancellation target
  accDescr: In separate disposable cases, a guided client retrieves R41 and follows the current cancel control to the new target, while a convention-dependent client constructs the retired target and receives a refusal. The provider rechecks current eligibility before cancellation.
  participant G as Guided client
  participant P as Provider release B
  participant C as Convention client
  Note over G,C: Independent disposable cases
  G->>P: Retrieve R41
  P-->>G: cancel relation with target B
  G->>P: Submit reason to target B
  Note right of P: Recheck current eligibility
  P-->>G: Cancellation acknowledged
  C->>P: Retrieve R41
  P-->>C: Same current control
  Note left of C: Construct target A
  C->>P: Submit to target A
  P-->>C: Retired target refused
